    C_R^TC_R|_{im(P)} nonzero eigs = [4.618, 3.618, 2.382, 1.382] × 120
      → C_T^TC_T eigs = n - these = [0.382, 1.382, 2.618, 3.618]

  t₃=6, β₁=1 (160 tournaments):
